id: typing-caret
section: Keyboard and text
item: Type in a page's field on the system keyboard: the characters land (the page's readout), the caret is there; holding Backspace repeats (the field empties)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-input-echo.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R2
calibrate echo
tap plain
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys abcdef
wait text echo 'value=[abcdef]' 6
key-hold kb-backspace 2500
wait text echo 'value=[] area' 6
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
